---

## AI Strategy

AI will be treated as an augmentation layer.

The project will investigate two primary areas.

### AI-Assisted Development

Using tools such as GitHub Copilot to support:

- Coding
- SQL
- Documentation
- Testing
- Refactoring

### AI-Assisted Decision Support

Using AI to:

- Summarize KPI changes
- Explain business trends
- Identify potential areas for investigation
- Convert analytical results into natural-language summaries

AI output will not be treated as authoritative without validation.

---

## Success Criteria

The first major version of the project will be considered successful when it contains:

- A reproducible data pipeline
- A documented data model
- Standardized KPI definitions
- At least one complete BI dashboard
- A data quality monitoring framework
- AI-assisted BI functionality
- Reproducible documentation
- Public GitHub repository

